      "writtenOn": "2026-03-25T13:18:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`motUtil_data.hbm_status` is set on the path of updating hbm status, so it should be equal to `dsi_panel_param[0][PARAM_HBM_ID]`, do I misunderstandd the logic here?",
      "parentUuid": "8b5c385e_68126e54",
      "revId": "d610a45634e45d0652f8d403b061b490c2fdc4d0",
