        "id": 10258
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-25T13:52:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "oh I see, `dsi_panel_param[0][PARAM_HBM_ID]` is altered by fod implementation so it could differ from livedisplay settimgs, which is in sync with `motUtil_data.hbm_status`. now that this change makes sense to me, just wondering if it\u0027s possible to reuse the infra of `DSI_CMD_SET_HBM_FOD_ON` so we don\u0027t maintain a separate `motUtil_data.hbm_status`?",
      "parentUuid": "b9701df5_065204c5",
      "revId": "d610a45634e45d0652f8d403b061b490c2fdc4d0",
      "serverId": "1ec6b3db-b2c1-4fa4-84a2-4c7efe89ba71"
